{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "79eb32a07643a0ed0ac4f7348292793fde72b3184638a0103f623d0d1e19443d", "ja": "（事務所の垣根を越えた合同ライブ。\n詩花の参加は、みんなのいい刺激になっているようだ）", "zh": "（跨越事务所界限的联合演唱会。\n诗花的参加，似乎给大家带来了很好的刺激。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "e829e99600e79a89e6cb5cdec61a1f32633773dcf72cb18ffcd22f62ad0f818e", "ja": "{$P$}、助けてください！\nボク、もう何が何だかわからなくて～！", "zh": "{$P$}，请帮帮我！\n我已经完全搞不清楚是怎么回事了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bfb1d0eebf3b980b223a6ef7c7e57e09d8586d6595a6bba24963e7c861680755", "ja": "え？　急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？怎么突然这样说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "083ae0f1278c7877d6612eb3d05e74ede7f4c97321cfdee78dbb7c2dc20e3fc3", "ja": "じつは……カワイイポーズの練習をしていたら、\n伊織に「方向性が違う」って、すごく言われて……。", "zh": "其实……我练习可爱姿势的时候，\n伊织一直说我“方向不对”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "555c337b7dc1c745a30cda74fe9ba8dc1d6368e22507fe1716de3d3fb9e920d8", "ja": "だから、亜利沙に協力を頼んで、\nいろんなアイドルのポーズを勉強してたんです。", "zh": "所以，我就拜托亜利沙帮忙，学习了各种偶像的姿势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "19ed77c099536a4222075982fa01002afbbb307ccbfd508514d422f9a236f2a3", "ja": "そしたら、本当にいろんなアイドルを次から次に見せて\nくれて……なんかもう、永遠に終わらなくて……！", "zh": "结果，她真的把各种各样的偶像一个接一个地展示给我看……感觉简直没完没了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1006_p", "source_sha256": "02ca5bfd93ab561a95c4ab3273195239839e1ebac02815ea2fa351a391a2ba88", "ja": "亜利沙に頼んでしまったか……。\nそれでたくさん見すぎて、混乱してきたんだな？", "zh": "是拜托亚利沙了啊……这么一来，看得太多，开始混乱了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "00d274ca55576926c247d7399a62437d7ae99e6df3102d629fb6483feec8e738", "ja": "はい……。『キレカワ』とか『夢カワ』なら\nボクも知ってるし、わかります。でも……。", "zh": "是的……像“酷美”和“梦幻美”这种，\n我也知道，也能理解。可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "3024a375f20a8929a20caec1b47d51d64ae38e4ac3b46d8bccf0dd437cdaae26", "ja": "『塩カワイイ』とか『ワルカワイイ』と、\n『カワイイ』を表す言葉が無限に出てくるんです！", "zh": "“咸可爱”啦、“坏可爱”啦，用来形容“可爱”的词语没完没了地冒出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "a110f976e04dc7ce5cf80de5b84bf047f7e856a5355777c894582b7a1c5b5bb3", "ja": "{$P$}、ボクに合うのは、どんな\nカワイイですか！？　ズバッと教えてください！", "zh": "{$P$}，适合我的，会是哪种可爱！？请一针见血地告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1010_p", "source_sha256": "dcb705304919d2e6e6804308cedd1a451cb7af8b74c40ee6ca1e4caee6b7020f", "ja": "わ、わかったから、少し落ち着いて！\nもっとこう、シンプルに考えていいと思う。", "zh": "我、我知道了，先冷静一下！\n我觉得可以再……想得更单纯一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3e331aa5d252755782fe6cbaa5edc5aee6e7b4aca7ab05c97af6d0b5c10bfdf9", "ja": "とにかく、真がカワイイと思ったポーズをする。\nそれだけだ。……簡単だろう？", "zh": "总之，就摆出真觉得可爱的姿势。就这么简单……很容易吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "8dcfbd03621ec72939dfe0e0b68ed5ef96ca99292e99f28525086644d69cf6c2", "ja": "え～っ、もっと真剣に考えてくださいよ！\nボク、本気で困ってるんですっ！", "zh": "诶～，请再认真考虑一下嘛！\n我是真的很困扰啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a6272a76057d1ab145732a5f2e2e30468efe7b09d8bdb3bfe45fefbffff2e74e", "ja": "こっちも真剣だよ。何がいいのかわからないまま\nポーズだけ真似ても、見てる人にはわかるんだ。", "zh": "我这边也很认真啊。连什么才好都没弄明白，\n就只会模仿姿势，观众可是看得出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5abe58cb06844e58c616649c05bf5a31d67a2457b707630ae8212f0031b5df47", "ja": "結局、自然に心から「カワイイ！」と思ってするポーズ\nじゃないと、見てる人にも伝わらないんだよ。", "zh": "说到底，还是得摆出那种自然而然、发自内心觉得“可爱！”的姿势，才能传达给看到的人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "b0a555deacc27ed9ceaebb118d854d099964deafd9e1f1e82d9a9401c1c0b79a", "ja": "自然に心から……。\nそっか、そうですよね。表面だけ真似たって……。", "zh": "发自内心地自然地……\n这样啊，确实如此。就算只是模仿表面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "3fb42af18705d9a004d1dfe04f00244ba2f242eaa981206ccc557c2b318bbdc5", "ja": "ボク、難しく考えすぎてました。みんなのポーズが\nカワイくて、ちょっと焦ってたのかも。えへへ……。", "zh": "我想得太复杂了。大家的姿势都好可爱，我可能有点着急了。嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4bab14cf5ab66caa08fec099f6d464e58a4791668cc024ee725c9c849643f057", "ja": "今は多種多様な『KAWAII』で溢れてるからな。\n真は真だけの『KAWAII』を信じればいい。", "zh": "现在到处都是形形色色的“KAWAII”。\n真只要相信属于自己的“KAWAII”就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "f911830427c4ae17de43f7a3bf3c04faa4d734d65ebfa33d39ede8758272a959", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nよーし、ボクだけの『KAWAII』を探して！", "zh": "谢谢！\n好——那就去寻找只属于我的『KAWAII』吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "904201d62ae367d0601ea4ef08de6530caea943f96d843f306fa97393e40b0dd", "ja": "『KAWAII』千本ノック、続けてきます！\nねえ、亜利沙～！", "zh": "『KAWAII』千本特训，我继续去啦！\n喂，亚利沙～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0563_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8017a165cbdbd333c4bb635a40a207df3eca4275fc48ba28709859c75c3aebce", "ja": "（千人で終わるといいんだが……。\nがんばれよ、真！）", "zh": "（要是能在一千人就结束就好了……加油，真！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
